{"id":"1d543e6e6f293638","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-binary-language-property-undecidability.md","title":"Rice's Theorem","display":"thm-rice — Rice's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-binary-language-property-undecidability","aliases":["73-thm-binary-language-property-undecidability","73-thm-rice"],"display":"thm-rice — Rice's Theorem","depends_on":["[[73-df-language-property-codes]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","[[73-df-paired-acceptance-language]]","[[73-thm-binary-universal-language-classification]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-binary-language-property-undecidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-binary-language-property-undecidability</span><span>73-thm-rice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rice — Rice's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"349bd461911980d1\" href=\"?note=349bd461911980d1\" title=\"73-df-language-property-codes\">73-df-language-property-codes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ff60c13bb604c68\" href=\"?note=8ff60c13bb604c68\" title=\"73-df-paired-acceptance-language\">73-df-paired-acceptance-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd777d11b311e27a\" href=\"?note=fd777d11b311e27a\" title=\"73-thm-binary-universal-language-classification\">73-thm-binary-universal-language-classification</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (fixed effective coding)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NontrivialLangProp}\">\\(\\operatorname{NontrivialLangProp}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}\">\\(I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}\\)</span> (language properties and their index languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"349bd461911980d1\" href=\"?note=349bd461911980d1\" title=\"73-df-language-property-codes\">73-df-language-property-codes</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\">\\(\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\\)</span> (decidable binary languages)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{NontrivialLangProp}(\\mathcal C)\n\\longrightarrow I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}\\notin\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{NontrivialLangProp}(\\mathcal C)\n\\longrightarrow I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}\\notin\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal C\">\\(\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal C\\)</span>, choose a recognizable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1\\in\\mathcal C\">\\(L_1\\in\\mathcal C\\)</span>. From an acceptance instance <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,w\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,w\\rangle\\)</span>, effectively build a machine that first simulates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> and, only after acceptance, recognizes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1\">\\(L_1\\)</span>, then canonically rename the result before taking its code. Language preservation makes the resulting indexed language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1\">\\(L_1\\)</span>, so deciding its index would decide universal acceptance.</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal C\">\\(\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal C\\)</span>, apply the preceding construction to the complementary property <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\\setminus\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\\setminus\\mathcal C\\)</span>; its index language is the complement of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}\">\\(I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}\\)</span> among valid machine codes. Thus every nontrivial extensional property is covered.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-language-property-codes","status":"resolved","id":"349bd461911980d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-language-property-codes]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-paired-acceptance-language","status":"resolved","id":"8ff60c13bb604c68","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-paired-acceptance-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-binary-universal-language-classification","status":"resolved","id":"fd777d11b311e27a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-universal-language-classification]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-language-property-codes","status":"resolved","id":"349bd461911980d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NontrivialLangProp}$ and $I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}$ (language properties and their index languages, see [[73-df-language-property-codes]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NontrivialLangProp}","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{NontrivialLangProp}(\\mathcal C)\n\\longrightarrow I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}\\notin\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"L_1\\in\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,w\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"L_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"L_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\\setminus\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}","display":false}],"bytes":1765,"backlinks":[{"id":"15bb24af84739cac","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["349bd461911980d1","004d4e2ba3fdd14e","8ff60c13bb604c68","fd777d11b311e27a"]}